<title>BELGIUM: EU ministers resolved to reach EMU budget accord.</title>
<headline>EU ministers resolved to reach EMU budget accord.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Union finance ministers are determined to reach a final accord on a budget stability pact by December for countries joining a single currency, diplomats said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;We've got a lot of pressure to agree on this,&quot; said one diplomat familiar with talks on the pact among ministers meeting here.</p>
</text>
